{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果於當地時間10月26日發佈iOS 27.2正式版，為旗下首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo帶來Apple Pencil手寫筆支持，同時新增名為Edge Light的面部補光功能。此外，此次更新還涉及Siri人工智能功能、照片應用、FaceTime視頻通話以及多款系統應用，蘋果也同步推出了macOS、watchOS、visionOS、tvOS和HomePod的軟件更新。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583954.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T19:20:16.082544+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T19:08:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:12.514080+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T19:18:12.514080+00:00","content_hash":"5765bc673949e5812cf030ed2ba3af4264fb81bd9e5dfccc6a8fa68d7b88d3ba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}